WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.402 --> 00:00:02.948
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Well, what do you want to see?

2
00:00:03.328 --> 00:00:05.661
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I want to see the real London.

3
00:00:08.871 --> 00:00:10.981
What size is this shirt?

4
00:00:11.204 --> 00:00:12.252
<v><b>Assistant:</b></v> Let’s see.

5
00:00:14.925 --> 00:00:15.934
It’s a small.

6
00:00:16.354 --> 00:00:22.329
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Listen, Izzy. My photography class has a little show next week.

7
00:00:24.111 --> 00:00:25.343
Do you want to come?

8
00:00:26.273 --> 00:00:28.540
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’d love to come. Thanks.

9
00:00:54.591 --> 00:00:55.980
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Come in?

10
00:00:57.972 --> 00:00:59.990
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Hi, Izzy.

11
00:01:01.405 --> 00:01:04.498
Here’s a parcel that came for you.

12
00:01:04.707 --> 00:01:06.122
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Thanks.

13
00:01:06.856 --> 00:01:08.193
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> You’re welcome.

14
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:19.357
Oh, I’m tired today.

15
00:01:26.198 --> 00:01:30.129
Izzy, you look worried.

16
00:01:31.728 --> 00:01:32.802
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Do I?

17
00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.419
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Yes, you do.

18
00:01:39.354 --> 00:01:41.398
Is everything OK?

19
00:01:42.971 --> 00:01:49.863
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes…No. I have a friend.

20
00:01:50.466 --> 00:01:54.162
He’s a photographer and he has his show today.

21
00:01:54.712 --> 00:01:56.311
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> A friend?

22
00:01:56.651 --> 00:01:59.875
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes. His name is Ben.

23
00:02:00.189 --> 00:02:05.903
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Ben. A good strong name. I like the name.

24
00:02:06.623 --> 00:02:09.598
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> And he’s a really nice guy, but…

25
00:02:09.755 --> 00:02:10.489
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> But?

26
00:02:11.944 --> 00:02:14.813
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> He goes to Tensquare School of Photography.

27
00:02:15.482 --> 00:02:16.019
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Ah.

28
00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:21.667
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> So I don’t know…I don’t really want to go back there.

29
00:02:21.889 --> 00:02:24.419
It was not a good time for me at that school.

30
00:02:25.781 --> 00:02:27.210
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> I remember, Izzy.

31
00:02:28.376 --> 00:02:30.853
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> But I really want to see Ben’s show…

32
00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:37.326
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Yes, well…if you like this boy, then go.

33
00:02:38.964 --> 00:02:40.418
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I think I like him.

34
00:02:41.585 --> 00:02:44.507
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Either you like him, or you don’t.

35
00:02:45.608 --> 00:02:47.626
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yes…I like him.

36
00:02:48.281 --> 00:02:50.024
<v><b>Pamela:</b></v> Then go to his show!

37
00:02:51.635 --> 00:02:54.112
Don’t worry about the past.

38
00:03:01.201 --> 00:03:02.276
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Hey, Mr Fischer.

39
00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:07.531
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Hi, Izzy. How are you?

40
00:03:08.671 --> 00:03:09.522
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I’m good.

41
00:03:10.780 --> 00:03:13.100
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Can you still come tonight?

42
00:03:16.323 --> 00:03:17.162
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Of course.

43
00:03:18.236 --> 00:03:19.966
I really want to see your show.

44
00:03:20.661 --> 00:03:27.999
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, cool. So it’s at the Click Gallery.

45
00:03:28.733 --> 00:03:30.331
Do you know where that is?

46
00:03:30.895 --> 00:03:35.114
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> No, but I’m sure I can find it. Don’t worry.

47
00:03:35.874 --> 00:03:39.596
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> OK, great.

48
00:03:41.404 --> 00:03:43.344
See you later.

49
00:03:43.711 --> 00:03:45.231
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> See you.